******************************************************
* MACRO-MODEL SIMULATED PARAMETERS:
******************************************************
* AC PARAMETERS
**********************
* CLOSED-LOOP OUTPUT IMPEDANCE VS. FREQUENCY (Zout vs. Freq.)
* CLOSED-LOOP GAIN AND PHASE VS. FREQUENCY CL EFFECTS (Acl vs. Freq.)
* COMMON-MODE REJECTION RATIO @ DC (CMRR)
* POWER SUPPLY REJECTION RATIO @ DC FREQUENCY (PSRR)
* INPUT VOLTAGE NOISE DENSITY VS. FREQUENCY (en vs. Freq.)
**********************
* DC PARAMETERS
**********************
* INPUT COMMON-MODE VOLTAGE RANGE (Vcm)
* OUTPUT VOLTAGE SWING vs. OUTPUT CURRENT (Vout vs. Iout)
* SHORT-CIRCUIT OUTPUT CURRENT (Isc)
* QUIESCENT CURRENT (Iq)
* INPUT CURRENT NOISE (in)
**********************
* TRANSIENT PARAMETERS
**********************
* SLEW RATE (SR)
**********************
* Change log
*Rev 1.0 to Rev 1.1: Update IQ to match validated silicon, confirm AC & DC performance
**********************
*
*****************************************************************************
.SUBCKT THS4535 IN+ IN- VOCM OUT+ OUT- VDD VSS
